&lt;p>Mojo module &lt;a href="https://github.com/ExtraMojo/ExtraMojo/blob/main/extramojo/bstr/memchr.mojo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🡭&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h1>&lt;code>memchr&lt;/code>&lt;/h1>&lt;p>Fast memchr implementations.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>There are two here, &lt;code>memchr&lt;/code> and &lt;code>memchr_wide&lt;/code>. &lt;code>memchr_wide&lt;/code> will do more comparisons at once,
but needs to do more loading first. If you know you have some distance between &lt;code>needle&lt;/code>s, then
it should be faster. &lt;code>memchr&lt;/code> is just vanilla memchr.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Aliases&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="aliases">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#aliases" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>SIMD_U8_WIDTH = simd_width_of[DType.uint8]()&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>LOOP_SIZE = (simd_width_of[DType.uint8]() * Int(4))&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2>Functions&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="functions">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#functions" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://extramojo.github.io/ExtraMojo/extramojo/bstr/memchr/memchr/" >&lt;code>memchr&lt;/code>&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://extramojo.github.io/ExtraMojo/extramojo/bstr/memchr/memchr_wide/" >&lt;code>memchr_wide&lt;/code>&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item></channel></rss>